      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinecrest%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The present Strawberry Dam, formerly Lower Strawberry Reservoir Dam, was constructed by Sierra and San Francisco Power Company for hydroelectric power.",
